# Phase 4 SEC bulk-data cache. Companyfacts + submissions zips are
# ~1.4 GB and ~1.5 GB respectively; never commit them. Every fact
# carries a `filed` date so point-in-time analysis from a newer zip
# gives the same answer for past dates.
quant/.cache/

# Phase 4 panel CSV: the full panel ships at ~13 MB (48 quarter-ends x
# ~1100 universe-eligible CIKs/quarter). The workflow commits it when
# it's under 5 MB; otherwise it stays as a workflow artifact only.
quant/research/distress_panel.csv

REVAMP_PLAN.md
public/pdfs/

